# `firstInRounds` is copied into `search`, and `upTo` is walked in place of the for-of. The `return` in the for-of stands behind the loop, in the region of the iteration, which is walked with the
# loop: inside the try of the loop over the rounds, whose mark is taken before the generator is opened. `drift` comes round as a number where 0 entered: that walk is undone. The way out of the copy
# that it noted went on standing in the list: a dead block handing on a dead value. It made the answer of the copy a boxed value and took every fact from the state behind the call.
